  "ingredients": [
    "4 tablespoon butter",
    "9 ounce cauliflower",
    "1/2 teaspoon italian seasoning",
    "1/2 teaspoon onion powder",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "4 tablespoon vegetable broth",
    "12 ounce shrimp",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/4 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1/2 medium lemon"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-shrimp-lemon-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53857-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Shrimp-and-Lemon-Cauliflower-Rice-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add the cauliflower rice with half of the butter, Italian seasoning, onion powder, lemon zest, and salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-shrimp-lemon-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53857-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Shrimp-and-Lemon-Cauliflower-Rice-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the butter has soaked up, add the vegetable stock to the pan. Stir and remove cauliflower from pan and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-shrimp-lemon-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53857-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Shrimp-and-Lemon-Cauliflower-Rice-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same pan, add in the garlic, rest of the butter, and olive oil and cook for 1 minute. Add the shrimp and the crushed red pepper flakes. Cook on both sides.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-shrimp-lemon-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53857-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Shrimp-and-Lemon-Cauliflower-Rice-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the shrimp is cooked thoroughly, add the cauliflower rice back to the pan to heat it up.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-shrimp-lemon-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53857-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Shrimp-and-Lemon-Cauliflower-Rice-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with lemon juice over the top. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-shrimp-lemon-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53857-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
